Cell["\<\
hoppingMatrices must be an association with numeric vector keys and \
SparseArray matrix values. Its first entry is treated as the onsite block \
without a phase factor.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1272313218,ExpressionUUID->"d075377c-0388-1d4a-8190-b857ef8c9d07"],

Cell["\<\
For every subsequent entry r -> h, the routine adds Exp[-I r.k] h and its \
Hermitian conjugate. Supply one representative of each reverse-hopping pair.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->496740581,ExpressionUUID->"ab321611-20be-2f45-8251-0599778ed092"],

Cell["The implemented phase convention is Exp[-I r.k].", "Notes",
 CellID->484207206,ExpressionUUID->"fb63850c-a2c6-c343-9fae-631b1e893ba9"]
}, Closed]],

